1
00:00:13,415 --> 00:00:14,124
爸?
Dad?

2
00:00:14,749 --> 00:00:15,540
Penny?
Penny?

3
00:00:16,874 --> 00:00:19,957
我感觉这不是个好主意
This does not seem like a very good idea.

4
00:00:22,207 --> 00:00:24,874
在好主意和我们最好的主意之间
There is a difference between a good idea

5
00:00:24,915 --> 00:00:26,124
是有分别的
and our best idea.

6
00:00:26,665 --> 00:00:29,624
可是我们也没时间用其他办法了
Sadly, we don't have time for much else.

7
00:00:30,915 --> 00:00:31,999
我们已经有足够系统上线
We have enough systems up

8
00:00:32,082 --> 00:00:34,415
可以广播我们的信息
and running to broadcast our message

9
00:00:34,624 --> 00:00:37,165
和让阿米特保持在大气轨道上
and keep Amity in atmospheric orbit.

10
00:00:37,915 --> 00:00:39,624
但是我们的推进器推力不够
But our thrusters just aren't capable

11
00:00:39,665 --> 00:00:39,749
但是我们的推进器推力不够

12
00:00:39,874 --> 00:00:42,249
无法自己升到目标高度
of reaching our target altitude on their own.

13
00:00:42,665 --> 00:00:45,124
哈 正好我们就坐在
Ha, fortunately, we're sitting

14
00:00:45,165 --> 00:00:47,540
几百吨推力的正上方
on a couple hundred tons of thrust.

15
00:00:49,665 --> 00:00:52,040
等我们一上到广播范围之后
Once we've passed into broadcasting range,

16
00:00:52,374 --> 00:00:54,207
我们就启动稳定器
we'll activate stabilizers,

17
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:56,499
重启环球通信
re-establish global communications,

18
00:00:56,665 --> 00:00:58,832
然后将录好的信息送到
and broadcast the message we've recorded out

19
00:00:58,957 --> 00:01:00,415
世界其他地方去
into the rest of the world.

20
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:04,082
之后 我们只要带阿米特
After that, we just have to pilot Amity

21
00:01:04,124 --> 00:01:06,582
离开这淌浑水就好了
away from all this mess.

22
00:01:07,582 --> 00:01:10,582
但是如果没人来支援擎天呢?
But what if no one is able to come and help Atlas?

23
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,999
如果我留下来 或许我可以
If I stay behind, I could maybe...

24
00:01:13,124 --> 00:01:16,290
Penny 我不会再讨论这件事了
Penny, we are not having this conversation again.

25
00:01:16,915 --> 00:01:19,290
我是你的父亲 我告诉你
I'm your father and I'm telling you

26
00:01:19,415 --> 00:01:21,707
你该留在阿米特
that you belong on Amity.

27
00:01:22,790 --> 00:01:24,040
是的 父亲大人
Yes, sir.

28
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:26,874
你不觉得Penny已经
Don't you think Penny

29
00:01:26,957 --> 00:01:29,332
听够了别人下达的指令了吗?
has had enough people telling her what to do?

30
00:01:31,999 --> 00:01:33,665
请准备发射吧
Prepare for launch, please.

31
00:01:34,374 --> 00:01:35,749
我要移动目标就位了
I'm moving us into position.

32
00:01:42,249 --> 00:01:43,624
全部系统都准备好了
All systems are ready.

33
00:01:45,207 --> 00:01:46,207
Penny?
Penny?

34
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:51,249
阿米特即刻请求发射
Amity is requesting launch access-

35
00:01:52,124 --> 00:01:52,999
来了
now.

36
00:02:00,124 --> 00:02:02,624
好 成功了!
Oh yes, it worked.

37
00:02:05,082 --> 00:02:08,540
呃 我没时间安装安全带了
Oh, I didn't have time to install seat belts,

38
00:02:08,874 --> 00:02:11,665
所以你们最好抓紧了
so I'd advise you to hang on.

39
00:02:28,332 --> 00:02:30,582
你们又想跑去哪里?
And where do you think you're going?

40
00:02:33,374 --> 00:02:34,582
Penny 不要!
Penny, no!

41
00:03:04,707 --> 00:03:05,665
是时候了
It's time.

42
00:03:08,624 --> 00:03:10,665
我还以为你的朋友们也在
I was hoping your friends would be here.

43
00:03:12,415 --> 00:03:14,665
但看来他们拋下你孤军作战了
But it looks like they left you to do all the work.

44
00:03:17,332 --> 00:03:19,332
你只是他们的工具人而已!
You're just a tool to be used!

45
00:03:20,332 --> 00:03:22,582
你根本不知道自己在说什么
You do not know what you are talking about.

46
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:41,332
给我滚远点 你这
Get away from her, you-

47
00:03:51,415 --> 00:03:54,374
又笨 又难操控 的死机器
Stupid, clunky, machine.

48
00:04:07,874 --> 00:04:08,832
咦
Hmm.

49
00:04:09,874 --> 00:04:10,540
吓?
Huh?

50
00:04:23,415 --> 00:04:24,249
要溜了!
Let's go.

51
00:04:27,707 --> 00:04:29,290
你又想怎样了?
And what do you want?

52
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,749
拜托了 拜托了 拜托!
Please, please, please!

53
00:04:43,332 --> 00:04:44,124
好啊!
Yes!

54
00:04:52,707 --> 00:04:54,582
我们在 飘离轨道?
We're drifting.

55
00:06:13,165 --> 00:06:13,832
休想!
No!

56
00:06:19,165 --> 00:06:20,790
你为什么要这样做?
Why are you doing this?

57
00:06:21,082 --> 00:06:22,999
为什么要效忠塞伦那样的人?
Why serve someone like Salem?

58
00:06:23,457 --> 00:06:25,290
我不效忠任何人
I don't serve anyone.

59
00:06:25,624 --> 00:06:26,707
如果不是你设计如此的话
And you wouldn't either,

60
00:06:26,749 --> 00:06:28,499
你也不会效忠他们
if you weren't built that way.

61
00:06:29,665 --> 00:06:30,582
不对
That is not...

62
00:06:31,874 --> 00:06:35,749
我选择为关心我的人而战
I choose to fight for people who care about me.

63
00:07:15,665 --> 00:07:16,624
罄德!
Cinder!

64
00:08:05,457 --> 00:08:07,624
啊!
Ahhhh.

65
00:08:10,165 --> 00:08:10,749
别别别
No no no!

66
00:08:10,832 --> 00:08:11,457
不要!
No!

67
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,999
我知道打不过你
I know I can't beat you,

68
00:08:24,082 --> 00:08:25,874
但是你打倒我之前
But I can fill that thing full of holes

69
00:08:25,957 --> 00:08:27,540
我能先给那东西穿几个洞
before you take me down.

70
00:08:41,332 --> 00:08:42,290
带我们走
Get us out of here.

71
00:08:43,249 --> 00:08:43,874
快!
Hurry.

72
00:08:49,499 --> 00:08:50,332
爸!
Dad!

73
00:08:53,624 --> 00:08:54,582
你没事吧?
Are you okay?

74
00:08:57,207 --> 00:08:59,082
稳定器被破坏了
The stabilizer was damaged.

75
00:09:00,582 --> 00:09:01,915
我们错过时机了
We've missed our window.

76
00:09:04,624 --> 00:09:05,540
这样下去
At this rate,

77
00:09:06,374 --> 00:09:07,874
我们大概会飘到
We're likely to drift into,

78
00:09:08,249 --> 00:09:09,915
降落在北-
touching down just north-

79
00:09:14,082 --> 00:09:15,290
我能解决这个问题
I can fix this.

80
00:09:15,915 --> 00:09:16,540
什么?
What?

81
00:09:17,457 --> 00:09:19,540
我们的信息就几分钟长而已
Our message is only a few minutes long.

82
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:22,415
我可以推动阿米特 直到
I can try and hold Amity in place until-

83
00:09:22,457 --> 00:09:23,915
不可以!
Absolutely not!

84
00:09:24,332 --> 00:09:25,332
你现在的状态
You're in no condition

85
00:09:25,499 --> 00:09:26,540
根本不适合这样做
to do something like this.

86
00:09:26,624 --> 00:09:28,082
单是外面的温度就-
Even just the temperature out there-

87
00:09:28,165 --> 00:09:29,874
我们别无选择了
It is our only option.

88
00:09:31,290 --> 00:09:32,874
她说得对 彼得罗
She is right Pietro.

89
00:09:33,582 --> 00:09:35,374
我们要以大局-
We have to remember the big picture-

90
00:09:35,457 --> 00:09:37,207
我才不管大局!
I don't care about the big picture!

91
00:09:37,290 --> 00:09:39,082
我只关心我的女儿!
I care about my daughter.

92
00:09:41,832 --> 00:09:43,082
我已经失去过你了
I lost you before.

93
00:09:44,540 --> 00:09:46,415
你又要让我再失去你一次吗?
Are you asking me to go through that again?

94
00:09:47,707 --> 00:09:50,290
我不要
No.

95
00:09:50,499 --> 00:09:53,249
我想看到你好好活着
I want the chance to watch you live your life.

96
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:03,457
爸
But Dad,

97
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:08,124
我正想这么做啊
I am trying to.

98
00:10:17,832 --> 00:10:18,540
也对
Right.

99
00:11:08,665 --> 00:11:09,749
来吧 Penny
Come on, Penny.

100
00:11:22,290 --> 00:11:24,165
好咧! 干得漂亮!
Yes! Atta girl!

101
00:11:29,665 --> 00:11:30,999
好了 你来说吧
Okay, go ahead.

102
00:11:32,374 --> 00:11:33,582
呃 啊
Um, uh.

103
00:11:34,415 --> 00:11:35,124
嗨
Hi.

104
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,790
我叫Ruby Rose
My name is Ruby Rose.

105
00:11:38,290 --> 00:11:39,290
是一个猎人
I'm a Huntress.

106
00:11:39,957 --> 00:11:41,915
如果我们走对了流程
And if we've done everything right,

107
00:11:42,582 --> 00:11:44,957
那么我现在应该在跟整个树不子说话
then I'm talking to all of Remnant right now.

108
00:11:45,832 --> 00:11:47,999
波伦迪娜教授之后可以做更多解释
Dr. Polendina can explain more later,

109
00:11:48,707 --> 00:11:50,374
但现在你们都需要知道
But right now you all need to know

110
00:11:50,415 --> 00:11:53,332
擎天王国正在被攻击
that the kingdom of Atlas is under attack.

111
00:11:54,790 --> 00:11:57,374
状况非常糟糕 我们需要帮助
Things are dire and we need help.

112
00:11:58,124 --> 00:12:00,290
但是拜托各位 请尽量不要恐慌
But please, try not to panic.

113
00:12:00,915 --> 00:12:03,415
这并不是什么新的敌人或侵略性的王国
This isn't some new enemy or invading kingdom.

114
00:12:03,915 --> 00:12:05,749
这是我们已经面对过的对手
This is a force we've faced before.

115
00:12:06,290 --> 00:12:07,207
我们与她抗衡几百年了
For centuries...

116
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:08,957
她是塞伦
Salem.

117
00:12:09,457 --> 00:12:10,124
兄弟
Dude.

118
00:12:11,207 --> 00:12:13,999
白牙袭击 擎天机器人军队
The White Fang, Atlesian Drones

119
00:12:14,624 --> 00:12:15,874
甚至戮兽们
Even the Grimm themselves

120
00:12:15,999 --> 00:12:18,665
全部都被她洗脑 被她掌控
have all been controlled and manipulated by her,

121
00:12:18,999 --> 00:12:21,332
就为了摧毁猎人学校
in order to tear down the Huntsmen Academies.

122
00:12:24,999 --> 00:12:27,665
我知道 少女们与圣器的事听着有些.
I know the idea of the maidens and relics seems...

123
00:12:28,207 --> 00:12:28,749
呃...
well....

124
00:12:29,624 --> 00:12:30,415
疯狂
crazy,

125
00:12:31,249 --> 00:12:33,040
但我保证信标学院的顾薇琦教授
but I promise Professor Goodwitch of Beacon

126
00:12:33,124 --> 00:12:34,832
以及遮阳学院的西奥多院长
and Headmaster Theodore of Shade

127
00:12:34,915 --> 00:12:36,415
可以为此作证
can verify all of this.

128
00:12:37,624 --> 00:12:38,540
他们甚至可能可以
They might even be able to

129
00:12:38,582 --> 00:12:40,290
帮助我们组织一次反击
help organize a way to fight back,

130
00:12:42,165 --> 00:12:42,540
但是
but,

131
00:12:42,582 --> 00:12:42,624
但是

132
00:12:43,999 --> 00:12:44,624
非常遗憾
sadly,

133
00:12:45,874 --> 00:12:48,082
我们已经不能继续信任埃隆伍德将军
General Ironwood can no longer be trusted.

134
00:12:51,582 --> 00:12:54,499
看来波伦迪娜的阻断计谋成功了
It seems Polendina's proxy trick worked,

135
00:12:55,415 --> 00:12:57,457
而这对我们来说是好消息
and that's good news for us.

136
00:12:58,290 --> 00:13:00,207
Penny的剑跟擎天的发射系统
Penny's blades operate on the same principle

137
00:13:00,290 --> 00:13:02,082
用的是一样的原理
as Amity in the launch terminal.

138
00:13:02,624 --> 00:13:04,332
为了让她能够控制一切
In order for her to control them all,

139
00:13:04,415 --> 00:13:06,415
它们需要互相沟通
they need to communicate with one another.

140
00:13:07,874 --> 00:13:08,707
我们曾没有足够的时间
We didn't have time

141
00:13:08,874 --> 00:13:09,832
去准备好应对塞伦
to prepare for Salem.

142
00:13:10,540 --> 00:13:11,790
但现在你们有!
But now you do!

143
00:13:13,540 --> 00:13:14,749
虽然她无法被摧毁
Just because she can't be destroyed,

144
00:13:14,832 --> 00:13:16,665
但那不代表她不会被击败
doesn't mean she can't be beaten.

145
00:13:17,457 --> 00:13:18,707
如果她真的那么无敌
If she really was unstoppable,

146
00:13:18,790 --> 00:13:21,457
她就不会至今都如此谨慎
she wouldn't have acted with such caution until now.

147
00:13:22,290 --> 00:13:23,707
她知道我们对她来说是威胁!
She knows we're a threat!

148
00:13:24,707 --> 00:13:25,582
所以就算我们
So even if we-

149
00:13:27,249 --> 00:13:28,707
就算擎天败落
even if Atlas falls,

150
00:13:29,332 --> 00:13:30,915
我们也不能放弃!
you can't give up!

151
00:13:39,582 --> 00:13:41,957
Penny! 你那怎么了?
Penny! What's going on out there?

152
00:13:43,165 --> 00:13:44,915
我 我不知道
I, I do not know.

153
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:48,624
我希望阿米特塔能够帮助大家 团结一致
I hope Amity tower will help bring us all together.

154
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:49,874
因为不管怎么说
Because, in the end,

155
00:13:49,999 --> 00:13:51,124
这就是我们获胜的方式
That's how we'll win.

156
00:13:52,624 --> 00:13:54,207
不! 不要断 回来啊!
No! No, come back!

157
00:13:59,124 --> 00:14:00,999
Penny 你已经做得很好了 乖孩子
Penny, you've done enough, sweetheart.

158
00:14:01,415 --> 00:14:02,665
快进来!
Get back inside!

159
00:14:02,874 --> 00:14:04,999
我们可以一起在阿米特上降落
We can ride out on Amity together.

160
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:07,499
我 我得走了!
I - I have to go!

161
00:14:07,832 --> 00:14:08,665
宝库
The vault.

162
00:14:10,165 --> 00:14:10,999
不
No!

163
00:14:11,999 --> 00:14:13,040
爸爸!
Dad!

164
00:14:19,165 --> 00:14:20,749
Penny! 到底怎么了?
Penny! What is happening?

165
00:14:22,665 --> 00:14:24,499
拜托了 宝贝女儿 你说句话啊
Please, baby, say something.

166
00:14:31,165 --> 00:14:32,249
我爱你
I love you.

167
00:14:33,165 --> 00:14:33,957
Penny!
Penny!

168
00:14:41,915 --> 00:14:42,499
Penny
Penny.

169
00:14:44,457 --> 00:14:46,082
世界通讯又断了
Global comms just went back down.

170
00:14:47,249 --> 00:14:48,582
Penny也没有回应
And Penny isn't responding.

171
00:14:50,290 --> 00:14:51,999
你做了什么?
What did you do?

172
00:14:52,874 --> 00:14:54,665
跟她要求的一样
Exactly what she asked.

173
00:14:55,499 --> 00:14:56,582
Penny的系统
It's possible Penny's systems

174
00:14:56,624 --> 00:14:57,832
可能是在重启
may have been rebooting.

175
00:14:58,540 --> 00:14:59,374
至于通讯塔嘛
As for the tower,

176
00:14:59,957 --> 00:15:03,332
呵 或许披得罗并不是你认为的那么天才
well, perhaps Pietro isn't the genius you thought-

177
00:15:07,165 --> 00:15:08,082
我们不会等下去了
We're not waiting.

178
00:15:09,165 --> 00:15:10,249
你去找到她
You're going to find her.

179
00:15:11,249 --> 00:15:11,915
温特
Winter.

180
00:15:13,790 --> 00:15:14,290
长官?
Sir?

181
00:15:15,540 --> 00:15:17,040
在Penny要么回应
Until Penny either responds

182
00:15:17,582 --> 00:15:19,165
要么站在宝库门口以前
or is standing in front of that vault,

183
00:15:20,082 --> 00:15:21,499
我们都不能确认她是敌是友
we can not assume her status.

184
00:15:22,915 --> 00:15:25,832
带着精英部队去 我要你们尽可能多的反馈状态
Take the Ace Ops. I want constant updates.

185
00:15:30,207 --> 00:15:31,999
把他带回牢房
Get him back to his cell.

186
00:15:33,165 --> 00:15:34,082
乐意至极
With pleasure.

187
00:15:37,915 --> 00:15:38,915
刚刚那个就是之前说的广播
That was the broadcast.

188
00:15:39,207 --> 00:15:40,124
我们怎么没信号了?
Why did we lose signal?

189
00:15:43,415 --> 00:15:44,374
还有一个
There's another one.

190
00:15:44,624 --> 00:15:46,165
应该就在前面
I think it's just up ahead.

191
00:15:49,374 --> 00:15:51,290
这 是什么?
What - is this?

192
00:16:01,874 --> 00:16:03,332
是戮兽
It's Grimm.

193
00:16:04,915 --> 00:16:06,582
一整条河流的戮兽
A river of Grimm-l

194
00:16:10,874 --> 00:16:12,790
正朝着王国的方向前进
heading straight for the kingdom.